[{"additionalPlain":"What to Expect in the Interview Process\nCurious about what comes next? Learn more about our hiring process here:http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process\n \nEqual Opportunity Employer:\nPatch My PC is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to a policy of equal treatment and opportunity in every aspect of its recruitment and hiring process. We encourage women, racial and ethnic minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply.\n \nWork Authorization:\nThis position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship. \nTo be eligible for consideration, candidates for fully remote positions must reside in one of the following U.S. states:\nAL, AK, AR, AZ, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, IA, ID, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA, ME, MI, MN, MO, MS, MT, NC, ND, NE, NH, NJ, NM, NV, OH, OK, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WV, WY.\n \n \n \n \n","additional":"<div>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ke0iyc\" data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"432\">What to Expect in the Interview Process</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2637\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong>Curious about what comes next? Learn more about our hiring process here:</strong> <a href=\"http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process\">http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2637\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Equal Opportunity Employer:</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Patch My PC is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to a policy of equal treatment and opportunity in every aspect of its recruitment and hiring process. We encourage women, racial and ethnic minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Work Authorization:</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">To be eligible for consideration, candidates for fully remote positions must reside in one of the following U.S. states:</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">AL, AK, AR, AZ, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, IA, ID, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA, ME, MI, MN, MO, MS, MT, NC, ND, NE, NH, NJ, NM, NV, OH, OK, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WV, WY.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>","categories":{"commitment":"Full-Time","location":"United States","team":"Finance","allLocations":["United States"]},"createdAt":1793047732731,"descriptionPlain":"About Our Company:\n \nAt Patch My PC, we exist to improve lives. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.\n \nOur core values guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.\n\n\nAbout this Role: \nPatch My PC is looking for a hands-on Business Intelligence Specialist to help build and maintain our enterprise data infrastructure and reporting capabilities. \nIn this role, you will work with data from multiple business systems, develop reliable data structures and support the creation of a centralized data warehouse. You'll play an important role in making business data accessible, accurate and useful for reporting and decision-making. \nWe're looking for someone who enjoys solving complex data challenges, takes ownership of technical deliverables and is excited to help build a new business intelligence function from the ground up. \n","description":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>About Our Company:</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At Patch My PC, we exist to <strong>improve lives</strong>. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Our <a href=\"https://patchmypc.com/values\"><strong><u>core values</u></strong></a> guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.</span></div><div><br></div><div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About this Role:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Patch My PC is looking for a hands-on Business Intelligence Specialist to help build and maintain our enterprise data infrastructure and reporting capabilities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">In this role, you will work with data from multiple business systems, develop reliable data structures and support the creation of a centralized data warehouse. You'll play an important role in making business data accessible, accurate and useful for reporting and decision-making.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We're looking for someone who enjoys solving complex data challenges, takes ownership of technical deliverables and is excited to help build a new business intelligence function from the ground up.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","id":"31674fe9-9a81-4675-9a1d-073d1188542a","lists":[{"text":"What You'll Do:","content":"<div>\n\n<li>Build and maintain data pipelines that extract, transform and integrate information from multiple business systems.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Develop SQL queries, data models and database structures to support enterprise reporting.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Support the implementation and ongoing development of a centralized enterprise data warehouse.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Organize, clean and validate data to improve accuracy, consistency and reliability.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Develop datasets and reporting solutions that support historical analysis, business performance tracking and operational KPIs.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Partner with Finance, Revenue Operations and other teams to understand data requirements and troubleshoot integration or reporting challenges.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Independently investigate data gaps, recommend solutions and deliver technical work with strong ownership and accountability.&nbsp;</li>\n\n</div>"},{"text":"What You'll Bring:","content":"<div>\n\n<li>3+ years of hands-on experience in business intelligence, data integration, database development or related technical data roles.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Strong SQL skills and experience working with relational databases, data models and large datasets.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience building data pipelines and integrating information from multiple systems.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Familiarity with cloud data platforms such as Snowflake, Databricks, Azure-based data solutions or similar technologies.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with data transformation, data quality and historical data management.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of reporting tools such as Power BI or Tableau.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Strong analytical thinking, troubleshooting skills and the ability to independently solve technical problems.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>A proactive, ownership-driven mindset with strong communication and collaboration skills.&nbsp;</li>\n\n</div>"},{"text":"Nice to Have ","content":"\n<li>Experience working with Salesforce, financial systems or other enterprise SaaS applications.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Familiarity with recurring-revenue metrics and operational reporting.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience helping build or improve data infrastructure in a growing organization.&nbsp;</li>\n"},{"text":"Compensation & Benefits:","content":"<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong>Competitive Base Salary:</strong> $100,000 - $125,000 based on experience and location.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Benefits:</strong></div>\n<div>\n\n<li><strong>401k Match:</strong>&nbsp;Match 200% of contributions up to the first 5% of salary, resulting in a total potential match of 10%.</li>\n<li><strong>Medical, Dental, and Vision Coverage:</strong>&nbsp;Patch My PC covers 99% of premiums for both team members and dependents.</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Other Benefits:</strong></div>\n\n<li>FSA/HSA.</li>\n<li>Fertility benefits.</li>\n<li>Parental leave.</li>\n<li>Paid-time off (PTO).</li>\n<li>Volunteer leave.</li>\n<li>Charitable donation matching.</li>\n<li>Tuition reimbursement.</li>\n<li>Gym membership reimbursement.</li>\n<li>Internet stipend.</li>\n<li>Pet insurance.</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><em>Learn more about our benefits here:&nbsp;<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://patchmypc.com/careers#we-care\" class=\"postings-link\">https://patchmypc.com/careers#we-care</a>.</em></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}],"salaryRange":{"min":100000,"max":125000,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-year-salary"},"text":"Business Intelligence Specialist","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>About Our Company:</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At Patch My PC, we exist to <strong>improve lives</strong>. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Our <a href=\"https://patchmypc.com/values\"><strong><u>core values</u></strong></a> guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.</span></div>","openingPlain":"About Our Company:\n \nAt Patch My PC, we exist to improve lives. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.\n \nOur core values guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.\n","descriptionBody":"<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">About this Role:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Patch My PC is looking for a hands-on Business Intelligence Specialist to help build and maintain our enterprise data infrastructure and reporting capabilities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">In this role, you will work with data from multiple business systems, develop reliable data structures and support the creation of a centralized data warehouse. You'll play an important role in making business data accessible, accurate and useful for reporting and decision-making.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">We're looking for someone who enjoys solving complex data challenges, takes ownership of technical deliverables and is excited to help build a new business intelligence function from the ground up.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"About this Role: \nPatch My PC is looking for a hands-on Business Intelligence Specialist to help build and maintain our enterprise data infrastructure and reporting capabilities. \nIn this role, you will work with data from multiple business systems, develop reliable data structures and support the creation of a centralized data warehouse. You'll play an important role in making business data accessible, accurate and useful for reporting and decision-making. \nWe're looking for someone who enjoys solving complex data challenges, takes ownership of technical deliverables and is excited to help build a new business intelligence function from the ground up. \n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/patchmypc/31674fe9-9a81-4675-9a1d-073d1188542a","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/patchmypc/31674fe9-9a81-4675-9a1d-073d1188542a/apply"},{"additionalPlain":"What to Expect in the Interview Process\nCurious about what comes next? Learn more about our hiring process here:http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process\n \nEqual Opportunity Employer:\nPatch My PC is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to a policy of equal treatment and opportunity in every aspect of its recruitment and hiring process. We encourage women, racial and ethnic minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply.\n \nWork Authorization:\nThis position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship. \nTo be eligible for consideration, candidates for fully remote positions must reside in one of the following U.S. states:\nAL, AK, AR, AZ, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, IA, ID, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA, ME, MI, MN, MO, MS, MT, NC, ND, NE, NH, NJ, NM, NV, OH, OK, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WV, WY.\n \n \n \n \n","additional":"<div>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ke0iyc\" data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"432\">What to Expect in the Interview Process</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2637\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong>Curious about what comes next? Learn more about our hiring process here:</strong> <a href=\"http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process\">http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2637\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Equal Opportunity Employer:</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Patch My PC is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to a policy of equal treatment and opportunity in every aspect of its recruitment and hiring process. We encourage women, racial and ethnic minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Work Authorization:</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">To be eligible for consideration, candidates for fully remote positions must reside in one of the following U.S. states:</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">AL, AK, AR, AZ, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, IA, ID, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA, ME, MI, MN, MO, MS, MT, NC, ND, NE, NH, NJ, NM, NV, OH, OK, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WV, WY.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>","categories":{"commitment":"Full-Time","location":"United States","team":"IT Security","allLocations":["United States"]},"createdAt":1790625585892,"descriptionPlain":"About Our Company:\n \nAt Patch My PC, we exist to improve lives. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.\n \nOur core values guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.\n\n\nAbout this Role:\n \nWe're hiring a Cloud Security Engineer to strengthen and operate our Microsoft cloud security stack. This is a hands-on engineering role: you'll build, tune, and maintain the security and compliance controls that protect organizational and customer data while bringing a red-team mindset to find weaknesses before attackers do. \nYou'll own the day-to-day engineering of our Microsoft Purview, Defender for Cloud, Entra, and Azure monitoring capabilities, translate technical risk into clear recommendations for leadership, and act as a trusted security advisor to internal teams and customers. This role sits at the intersection of security engineering, cloud operations, and governance, ideal for someone who likes to build controls, break assumptions, and measurably improve security posture. \n","description":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>About Our Company:</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At Patch My PC, we exist to <strong>improve lives</strong>. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Our <a href=\"https://patchmypc.com/values\"><strong><u>core values</u></strong></a> guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.</span></div><div><br></div><div><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">About this Role:</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We're hiring a </span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Cloud Security Engineer</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> to strengthen and operate our Microsoft cloud security stack. This is a hands-on engineering role: you'll build, tune, and maintain the security and compliance controls that protect organizational and customer data while bringing a red-team mindset to find weaknesses before attackers do.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You'll own the day-to-day engineering of our Microsoft Purview, Defender for Cloud, Entra, and Azure monitoring capabilities, translate technical risk into clear recommendations for leadership, and act as a trusted security advisor to internal teams and customers. This role sits at the intersection of </span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">security engineering, cloud operations, and governance</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, ideal for someone who likes to build controls, break assumptions, and measurably improve security posture.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","id":"c6ae9e75-99a1-47fd-8e1b-6b8477fb1902","lists":[{"text":"Responsibilities:","content":"<div>\n<p><strong>Cloud Security Engineering &amp; Operations&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<li>Design, deploy, configure, and maintain Microsoft cloud security and compliance technologies, including Microsoft Purview, Microsoft Defender for Cloud, Azure Log Analytics, Microsoft Entra ID, Privileged Identity Management (PIM), and Identity Governance.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Engineer and continuously improve technical security controls across Microsoft 365 and Azure.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Automate recurring security and compliance tasks to reduce manual effort and drift.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Monitor security and compliance posture, and drive continuous-improvement initiatives with measurable outcomes.&nbsp;</li>\n\n<p><strong>Data Protection &amp; AI Governance&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<li>Build, deploy, and maintain Data Loss Prevention (DLP) policies across the organisation.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Monitor AI technology usage and engineer controls to mitigate data exposure, information leakage, and inappropriate use.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Assess emerging AI-related threats and implement appropriate governance and technical guardrails.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Partner with internal teams to ensure sensitive data is adequately protected.&nbsp;</li>\n\n<p><strong>Threat Assessment &amp; Security Reviews&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<li>Apply a red-team mindset to proactively identify weaknesses in systems, configurations, processes, and controls.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Conduct security reviews, exposure assessments, and control-effectiveness evaluations.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Produce clear, concise reports for leadership covering findings, risk assessments, control gaps, and prioritized remediation recommendations.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Track remediation and support stakeholders in implementing corrective actions.&nbsp;</li>\n\n<p><strong>Monitoring &amp; Incident Support&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<li>Use Azure Log Analytics and security tooling (e.g., KQL queries, alerting) to detect suspicious activity, trends, and compliance issues.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Support security investigations and incident response, including analysis, containment, and remediation recommendations.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Customer &amp; Stakeholder Engagement&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Represent security and compliance in customer calls covering governance, data protection, and control topics.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Support the compliance team on customer questionnaires, assessments, and security reviews.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Communicate technical concepts effectively to both technical and non-technical audiences.&nbsp;</li>\n\n</div>"},{"text":"Required Skills:","content":"\n<li>7+ years of hands-on experience engineering and operating Microsoft cloud security technologies: Purview, Defender for Cloud, Azure Log Analytics, Entra ID, PIM, Identity Governance, and DLP.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Solid understanding of cloud security principles and Microsoft 365 / Azure security controls.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience investigating security risks and identifying control weaknesses.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Comfort writing queries (e.g., KQL) and automating tasks (PowerShell, Graph API, or similar) is a strong plus.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Willingness and ability to travel. Tthis role may require travel to customers to discuss our security practices and showcase how our tooling improves their security posture.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to think from an attacker's perspective.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Excellent written communication, able to produce professional reports and executive summaries.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Strong presentation and customer-facing communication skills.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Able to work independently in a remote setting while collaborating with distributed teams.&nbsp;</li>\n"},{"text":"Nice to Have:","content":"\n<li>Microsoft security certifications (SC-200, SC-300, SC-400, AZ-500, or equivalent).&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with compliance frameworks such as ISO 27001, SOC 2, GDPR, or similar.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with security governance, risk, and compliance (GRC) programmes.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Exposure to AI governance, security, or responsible-AI initiatives.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience as a consultant in Configuration Manager, Intune and other related technologies.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience at leading customer focused workshops. &nbsp;</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ideal Candidate</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">A hands-on cloud security engineer who enjoys building and tuning controls, finding weaknesses before attackers do, translating technical risk into business recommendations, and helping organizations, both ours and our customers mature their security posture. Equally comfortable in a config console, a log-analytics query, and a customer call.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>"},{"text":"Compensation & Benefits:","content":"<div>\n<div><strong>Competitive Base Salary:</strong> $110,000 - $145,000 based on experience and location.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Benefits:</strong></div>\n<div>\n\n<li><strong>401k Match:</strong>&nbsp;Match 200% of contributions up to the first 5% of salary, resulting in a total potential match of 10%.</li>\n<li><strong>Medical, Dental, and Vision Coverage:</strong>&nbsp;Patch My PC covers 99% of premiums for both team members and dependents.</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Other Benefits:</strong></div>\n\n<li>FSA/HSA.</li>\n<li>Fertility benefits.</li>\n<li>Parental leave.</li>\n<li>Paid-time off (PTO).</li>\n<li>Volunteer leave.</li>\n<li>Charitable donation matching.</li>\n<li>Tuition reimbursement.</li>\n<li>Gym membership reimbursement.</li>\n<li>Internet stipend.</li>\n<li>Pet insurance.</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><em>Learn more about our benefits here:&nbsp;<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://patchmypc.com/careers#we-care\" class=\"postings-link\">https://patchmypc.com/careers#we-care</a>.</em></div>\n</div>\n</div>"}],"salaryRange":{"min":110000,"max":145000,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-year-salary"},"text":"Cloud Security Engineer","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>About Our Company:</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At Patch My PC, we exist to <strong>improve lives</strong>. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Our <a href=\"https://patchmypc.com/values\"><strong><u>core values</u></strong></a> guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.</span></div>","openingPlain":"About Our Company:\n \nAt Patch My PC, we exist to improve lives. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.\n \nOur core values guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.\n","descriptionBody":"<div><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">About this Role:</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">We're hiring a </span><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Cloud Security Engineer</span><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"> to strengthen and operate our Microsoft cloud security stack. This is a hands-on engineering role: you'll build, tune, and maintain the security and compliance controls that protect organizational and customer data while bringing a red-team mindset to find weaknesses before attackers do.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">You'll own the day-to-day engineering of our Microsoft Purview, Defender for Cloud, Entra, and Azure monitoring capabilities, translate technical risk into clear recommendations for leadership, and act as a trusted security advisor to internal teams and customers. This role sits at the intersection of </span><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">security engineering, cloud operations, and governance</span><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">, ideal for someone who likes to build controls, break assumptions, and measurably improve security posture.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"About this Role:\n \nWe're hiring a Cloud Security Engineer to strengthen and operate our Microsoft cloud security stack. This is a hands-on engineering role: you'll build, tune, and maintain the security and compliance controls that protect organizational and customer data while bringing a red-team mindset to find weaknesses before attackers do. \nYou'll own the day-to-day engineering of our Microsoft Purview, Defender for Cloud, Entra, and Azure monitoring capabilities, translate technical risk into clear recommendations for leadership, and act as a trusted security advisor to internal teams and customers. This role sits at the intersection of security engineering, cloud operations, and governance, ideal for someone who likes to build controls, break assumptions, and measurably improve security posture. \n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/patchmypc/c6ae9e75-99a1-47fd-8e1b-6b8477fb1902","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/patchmypc/c6ae9e75-99a1-47fd-8e1b-6b8477fb1902/apply"},{"additionalPlain":"What to Expect in the Interview Process\nCurious about what comes next? Learn more about our hiring process here:http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process\n \nEqual Opportunity Employer:\nPatch My PC is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to a policy of equal treatment and opportunity in every aspect of its recruitment and hiring process. We encourage women, racial and ethnic minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply.\n \nWork Authorization:\nThis position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship. \nTo be eligible for consideration, candidates for fully remote positions must reside in one of the following U.S. states:\nAL, AK, AR, AZ, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, IA, ID, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA, ME, MI, MN, MO, MS, MT, NC, ND, NE, NH, NJ, NM, NV, OH, OK, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WV, WY.\n \n \n \n \n","additional":"<div>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ke0iyc\" data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"432\">What to Expect in the Interview Process</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2637\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong>Curious about what comes next? Learn more about our hiring process here:</strong> <a href=\"http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process\">http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2637\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Equal Opportunity Employer:</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Patch My PC is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to a policy of equal treatment and opportunity in every aspect of its recruitment and hiring process. We encourage women, racial and ethnic minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Work Authorization:</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">To be eligible for consideration, candidates for fully remote positions must reside in one of the following U.S. states:</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">AL, AK, AR, AZ, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, IA, ID, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA, ME, MI, MN, MO, MS, MT, NC, ND, NE, NH, NJ, NM, NV, OH, OK, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WV, WY.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>","categories":{"commitment":"Full-Time","location":"United States","team":"Finance","allLocations":["United States"]},"createdAt":1793047520322,"descriptionPlain":"About Our Company:\n \nAt Patch My PC, we exist to improve lives. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.\n \nOur core values guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.\n\n\nAbout this Role: \nPatch My PC is looking for an experienced hands-on Manager, Business Intelligence Architecture to build and lead our enterprise data and business intelligence capabilities. \nIn this role, you will design and establish a scalable enterprise data warehouse, integrate data across business systems and create the foundation for reliable, historical reporting and business insights. You will partner with leaders across Finance, Revenue Operations, Customer Success and People to improve how we organize, access and use data to make informed business decisions. \nWe're looking for a builder who has successfully developed enterprise data environments, brings strong technical judgment and takes ownership from strategy through execution. \n","description":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>About Our Company:</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At Patch My PC, we exist to <strong>improve lives</strong>. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Our <a href=\"https://patchmypc.com/values\"><strong><u>core values</u></strong></a> guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.</span></div><div><br></div><div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About this Role:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Patch My PC is looking for an experienced hands-on Manager, Business Intelligence Architecture to build and lead our enterprise data and business intelligence capabilities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">In this role, you will design and establish a scalable enterprise data warehouse, integrate data across business systems and create the foundation for reliable, historical reporting and business insights. You will partner with leaders across Finance, Revenue Operations, Customer Success and People to improve how we organize, access and use data to make informed business decisions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We're looking for a builder who has successfully developed enterprise data environments, brings strong technical judgment and takes ownership from strategy through execution.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","id":"96e36f66-20a8-4acf-ab54-ea3a23bbf9bf","lists":[{"text":"What You'll Do:","content":"<div>\n\n<li>Design and build a scalable enterprise data warehouse and reporting infrastructure from the ground up.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Evaluate and recommend data architecture, cloud platforms and reporting solutions, balancing scalability, cost and business needs.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Establish data models, integration frameworks and data management practices that support enterprise-wide reporting.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Partner with business leaders to understand reporting needs, advise on data architecture and develop meaningful business intelligence solutions.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Enable historical reporting, trend analysis and performance tracking across key business metrics, including SaaS revenue, retention and operational KPIs.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Serve as a technical center of excellence for enterprise data management while providing hands-on leadership and guidance to a growing BI function.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Own project delivery, proactively resolve technical challenges and communicate progress, risks and recommendations to stakeholders.&nbsp;</li>\n\n</div>"},{"text":"What You'll Bring:","content":"\n<li>8+ years of experience in enterprise data architecture, business intelligence or data management, including building scalable data environments.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Proven experience designing and implementing enterprise data warehouses and integrating data across multiple business systems.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Strong SQL, data modeling, database architecture and data integration expertise.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience with cloud data platforms such as Snowflake, Databricks, Azure-based data solutions or similar technologies.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience evaluating data technologies and making architecture recommendations based on business requirements.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Familiarity with business intelligence and reporting tools such as Power BI or Tableau.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Ability to translate complex technical concepts into practical recommendations for business and executive stakeholders.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Strong ownership, independent problem-solving skills and a track record of delivering complex initiatives with minimal oversight.&nbsp;</li>\n"},{"text":"Nice to Have ","content":"<div>\n\n<li>Experience supporting enterprise reporting in a SaaS or recurring-revenue business.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Familiarity with Salesforce, financial systems and operational data sources.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience mentoring or leading technical team members.&nbsp;</li>\n\n</div>"},{"text":"Compensation & Benefits:","content":"<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong>Competitive Base Salary:</strong> $135,000 - $170,000 based on experience and location.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Benefits:</strong></div>\n<div>\n\n<li><strong>401k Match:</strong>&nbsp;Match 200% of contributions up to the first 5% of salary, resulting in a total potential match of 10%.</li>\n<li><strong>Medical, Dental, and Vision Coverage:</strong>&nbsp;Patch My PC covers 99% of premiums for both team members and dependents.</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Other Benefits:</strong></div>\n\n<li>FSA/HSA.</li>\n<li>Fertility benefits.</li>\n<li>Parental leave.</li>\n<li>Paid-time off (PTO).</li>\n<li>Volunteer leave.</li>\n<li>Charitable donation matching.</li>\n<li>Tuition reimbursement.</li>\n<li>Gym membership reimbursement.</li>\n<li>Internet stipend.</li>\n<li>Pet insurance.</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><em>Learn more about our benefits here:&nbsp;<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://patchmypc.com/careers#we-care\" class=\"postings-link\">https://patchmypc.com/careers#we-care</a>.</em></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}],"salaryRange":{"min":135000,"max":170000,"currency":"USD","interval":"per-year-salary"},"text":"Manager, Business Intelligence Architecture","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>About Our Company:</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At Patch My PC, we exist to <strong>improve lives</strong>. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Our <a href=\"https://patchmypc.com/values\"><strong><u>core values</u></strong></a> guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.</span></div>","openingPlain":"About Our Company:\n \nAt Patch My PC, we exist to improve lives. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.\n \nOur core values guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.\n","descriptionBody":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">About this Role:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Patch My PC is looking for an experienced hands-on Manager, Business Intelligence Architecture to build and lead our enterprise data and business intelligence capabilities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">In this role, you will design and establish a scalable enterprise data warehouse, integrate data across business systems and create the foundation for reliable, historical reporting and business insights. You will partner with leaders across Finance, Revenue Operations, Customer Success and People to improve how we organize, access and use data to make informed business decisions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">We're looking for a builder who has successfully developed enterprise data environments, brings strong technical judgment and takes ownership from strategy through execution.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"About this Role: \nPatch My PC is looking for an experienced hands-on Manager, Business Intelligence Architecture to build and lead our enterprise data and business intelligence capabilities. \nIn this role, you will design and establish a scalable enterprise data warehouse, integrate data across business systems and create the foundation for reliable, historical reporting and business insights. You will partner with leaders across Finance, Revenue Operations, Customer Success and People to improve how we organize, access and use data to make informed business decisions. \nWe're looking for a builder who has successfully developed enterprise data environments, brings strong technical judgment and takes ownership from strategy through execution. \n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/patchmypc/96e36f66-20a8-4acf-ab54-ea3a23bbf9bf","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/patchmypc/96e36f66-20a8-4acf-ab54-ea3a23bbf9bf/apply"},{"additionalPlain":"What to Expect in the Interview Process\nCurious about what comes next? Learn more about our hiring process here:http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process\n \nEqual Opportunity Employer:\nPatch My PC is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to a policy of equal treatment and opportunity in every aspect of its recruitment and hiring process. We encourage women, racial and ethnic minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply.\n \nWork Authorization:\nThis position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship. \nTo be eligible for consideration, candidates for fully remote positions must reside in one of the following U.S. states:\nAL, AK, AR, AZ, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, IA, ID, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA, ME, MI, MN, MO, MS, MT, NC, ND, NE, NH, NJ, NM, NV, OH, OK, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WV, WY.\n \n \n \n \n","additional":"<div>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ke0iyc\" data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"432\">What to Expect in the Interview Process</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2637\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong>Curious about what comes next? Learn more about our hiring process here:</strong> <a href=\"http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process\">http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2637\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Equal Opportunity Employer:</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Patch My PC is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to a policy of equal treatment and opportunity in every aspect of its recruitment and hiring process. We encourage women, racial and ethnic minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Work Authorization:</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">To be eligible for consideration, candidates for fully remote positions must reside in one of the following U.S. states:</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">AL, AK, AR, AZ, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, IA, ID, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA, ME, MI, MN, MO, MS, MT, NC, ND, NE, NH, NJ, NM, NV, OH, OK, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WV, WY.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>","categories":{"commitment":"Full-Time","location":"United States","team":"Engineering","allLocations":["United States"]},"createdAt":1780695524891,"descriptionPlain":"About Our Company:\n \nAt Patch My PC, we exist to improve lives. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.\n \nOur core values guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.\n\n\nAbout this Role:\n \nAre you seeking a dynamic environment where you get to dive deep into a range of projects bootstrapping AI development?   \nWe’re seeking a passionate and curious Software Engineer, AI to join our growing emerging technology team. This role is ideal for someone with foundational experience in AI and a keen interest in agentic frameworks, autonomous systems, and intelligent workflows. You’ll be embedded with development to ideate, architect and develop AI automation for both internal productivity and customer product solutions.    Passion and drive for creating proof of concepts and evolving to production quality is essential.  You should also be comfortable dealing with ambiguity, and enjoy educating and equipping fellow developers on AI solutions. \n","description":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>About Our Company:</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At Patch My PC, we exist to <strong>improve lives</strong>. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Our <a href=\"https://patchmypc.com/values\"><strong><u>core values</u></strong></a> guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.</span></div><div><br></div><div><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">About this Role:</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Are you seeking a dynamic environment where you get to dive deep into a range of projects bootstrapping AI development?&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We’re seeking a passionate and curious Software Engineer, AI</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> to join our growing emerging technology team. This role is ideal for someone with foundational experience in AI and a keen interest in agentic frameworks, autonomous systems, and intelligent workflows. You’ll be embedded with development to ideate, architect and develop AI automation for both internal productivity and customer product solutions.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Passion and drive for creating proof of concepts and evolving to production quality is essential.&nbsp; You should also be comfortable dealing with ambiguity, and enjoy educating and equipping fellow developers on AI solutions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","id":"a71b827b-c926-4966-9207-dcc4dff7719a","lists":[{"text":"Responsibilities:","content":"<div>\n<div>\n\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Design and develop generative AI solutions across a rapidly expanding product portfolio</span></li>\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Develop and deploy AI agents for internal tools and customer-facing applications</span></li>\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Collaborate with cross-functional teams to integrate AI tech into existing systems</span></li>\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Identify optimum data processing and structure for accurate AI analysis</span></li>\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Write clean, maintainable code in C#, Python or other relevant languages</span></li>\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Translate requirements into clear engineering deliverables, track progress, and communicate status through stand-ups and stakeholder updates</span></li>\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Conduct testing, debugging, and performance optimization of AI agent workflows</span></li>\n<li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Stay up-to-date with the latest research and trends in commercial AI systems</span></li>\n\n</div>\n</div>"},{"text":"Required Skills:","content":"<div>\n\n<li>Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, or related field (or equivalent experience)</li>\n<li>5+ years of professional software development with C# and the .NET ecosystem&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Familiarity with a AI agent framework (e.g., LangChain, CrewAI, AutoGPT, MetaGPT)</li>\n<li>Good understanding of LLMs (e.g., GPT, Claude, Mistral) and prompt engineering</li>\n<li>Experience with AI libraries (e.g., Transformers, OpenAI API, Hugging Face)</li>\n<li>Experience with GenAI data pre-processing and embedding&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with REST APIs and at least one cloud platform (Azure, AWS, GCP)&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with MongoDB or similar NoSQL databases&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Proficiency with Git workflows, branching strategies, and code review&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Strong problem-solving skills and eagerness to learn in a fast-paced environment</li>\n\n</div>"},{"text":"Nice to Have:","content":"\n<li>Knowledge of agent memory, planning, and tool-use strategies</li>\n<li>Familiarity with containerization (Docker) and CI/CD pipelines</li>\n<li>Contributions to open-source AI projects or personal agent-based experiments</li>\n"},{"text":"Compensation & Benefits:","content":"<div>\n<div><em><span data-teams=\"true\">We are hiring across multiple levels, with final leveling and compensation determined by the candidate's skills, experience and demonstrated capabilities throughout the interview process.</span></em></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Benefits:</strong></div>\n<div>\n\n<li><strong>401k Match:</strong>&nbsp;Match 200% of contributions up to the first 5% of salary, resulting in a total potential match of 10%.</li>\n<li><strong>Medical, Dental, and Vision Coverage:</strong>&nbsp;Patch My PC covers 99% of premiums for both team members and dependents.</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Other Benefits:</strong></div>\n\n<li>FSA/HSA.</li>\n<li>Fertility benefits.</li>\n<li>Parental leave.</li>\n<li>Paid-time off (PTO).</li>\n<li>Volunteer leave.</li>\n<li>Charitable donation matching.</li>\n<li>Tuition reimbursement.</li>\n<li>Gym membership reimbursement.</li>\n<li>Internet stipend.</li>\n<li>Pet insurance.</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><em>Learn more about our benefits here:&nbsp;<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://patchmypc.com/careers#we-care\" class=\"postings-link\">https://patchmypc.com/careers#we-care</a>.</em></div>\n</div>\n</div>"}],"text":"Software Engineer, AI","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>About Our Company:</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At Patch My PC, we exist to <strong>improve lives</strong>. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Our <a href=\"https://patchmypc.com/values\"><strong><u>core values</u></strong></a> guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.</span></div>","openingPlain":"About Our Company:\n \nAt Patch My PC, we exist to improve lives. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.\n \nOur core values guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.\n","descriptionBody":"<div><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">About this Role:</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Are you seeking a dynamic environment where you get to dive deep into a range of projects bootstrapping AI development?&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">We&rsquo;re seeking a passionate and curious Software Engineer, AI</span><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"> to join our growing emerging technology team. This role is ideal for someone with foundational experience in AI and a keen interest in agentic frameworks, autonomous systems, and intelligent workflows. You&rsquo;ll be embedded with development to ideate, architect and develop AI automation for both internal productivity and customer product solutions.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Passion and drive for creating proof of concepts and evolving to production quality is essential.&nbsp; You should also be comfortable dealing with ambiguity, and enjoy educating and equipping fellow developers on AI solutions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"About this Role:\n \nAre you seeking a dynamic environment where you get to dive deep into a range of projects bootstrapping AI development?   \nWe’re seeking a passionate and curious Software Engineer, AI to join our growing emerging technology team. This role is ideal for someone with foundational experience in AI and a keen interest in agentic frameworks, autonomous systems, and intelligent workflows. You’ll be embedded with development to ideate, architect and develop AI automation for both internal productivity and customer product solutions.    Passion and drive for creating proof of concepts and evolving to production quality is essential.  You should also be comfortable dealing with ambiguity, and enjoy educating and equipping fellow developers on AI solutions. \n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/patchmypc/a71b827b-c926-4966-9207-dcc4dff7719a","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/patchmypc/a71b827b-c926-4966-9207-dcc4dff7719a/apply"},{"additionalPlain":"What to Expect in the Interview Process\nCurious about what comes next? Learn more about our hiring process here:http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process\n \nEqual Opportunity Employer:\nPatch My PC is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to a policy of equal treatment and opportunity in every aspect of its recruitment and hiring process. We encourage women, racial and ethnic minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply.\n \nWork Authorization:\nThis position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship. \nTo be eligible for consideration, candidates for fully remote positions must reside in one of the following U.S. states:\nAL, AK, AR, AZ, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, IA, ID, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA, ME, MI, MN, MO, MS, MT, NC, ND, NE, NH, NJ, NM, NV, OH, OK, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WV, WY.\n \n \n \n \n","additional":"<div>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ke0iyc\" data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"432\">What to Expect in the Interview Process</h3>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2637\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong>Curious about what comes next? Learn more about our hiring process here:</strong> <a href=\"http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process\">http://patchmypc.com/careers#hiring-process</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2637\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Equal Opportunity Employer:</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Patch My PC is an Equal Opportunity Employer and is committed to a policy of equal treatment and opportunity in every aspect of its recruitment and hiring process. We encourage women, racial and ethnic minorities, individuals with disabilities, and veterans to apply.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Work Authorization:</span></strong></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">To be eligible for consideration, candidates for fully remote positions must reside in one of the following U.S. states:</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">AL, AK, AR, AZ, CA, CO, CT, DE, FL, GA, HI, IA, ID, IL, IN, KS, KY, LA, ME, MI, MN, MO, MS, MT, NC, ND, NE, NH, NJ, NM, NV, OH, OK, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WV, WY.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>","categories":{"commitment":"Full-Time","location":"United States","team":"Engineering","allLocations":["United States"]},"createdAt":1774639239236,"descriptionPlain":"About Our Company:\n \nAt Patch My PC, we exist to improve lives. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.\n \nOur core values guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.\n\n\nAbout this Role:\n \nWe are looking to hire an Experienced Software Engineer to design, develop, implement, test and support high quality internal software, systems and customer facing products and features that delight customers. You will be a key member of our development team, working to enhance and expand our software management platform. \n","description":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>About Our Company:</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At Patch My PC, we exist to <strong>improve lives</strong>. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Our <a href=\"https://patchmypc.com/values\"><strong><u>core values</u></strong></a> guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.</span></div><div><br></div><div>\n<div><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">About this Role:</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">We are looking to hire an Experienced Software Engineer to design, develop, implement, test and support high quality internal software, systems and customer facing products and features that delight customers. You will be a key member of our development team, working to enhance and expand our software management platform.&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>","id":"21f4037e-2b38-4f87-8877-fd4096d36e7f","lists":[{"text":"Responsibilities:","content":"<div>\n\n<li>Writing secure, correct, efficient, clear and supportable “production ready” code that meets internal standards and industry best practice.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Enhance and extend our existing products, including device management, microservices applications to deliver seamless experiences to our customers.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Design and build APIs that integrate with internal and external services and contribute to overall system functionality.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Clarifying and communicating engineering requirements for new products, features, quality improvements, or design changes.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Track progress, update stakeholders, communicate with peers and broader team through stand-ups, regular updates on work items.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Implement industry-standard security practices to safeguard both customer and internal data.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Ensure thorough testing of code, participate in code reviews, and proactively resolve bugs and performance bottlenecks.&nbsp;</li>\n\n</div>"},{"text":"Required Skills:","content":"<div>\n\n<li>5+ years of professional development experience in C#.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with ASP.NET Core microservices and distributes systems.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Strong experience in API Development, particularly with RESTful APIs.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with MongoDB or similar NoSQL databases.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Familiarity with security practices in software development, such as secure coding, encryption, and data protection.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Strong understanding of object-oriented programming (OOP) and design patterns.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Proficiency in Git for version control and collaborative development.&nbsp;</li>\n\n</div>"},{"text":"Nice to Have:","content":"\n<li>Experience with device management products like Microsoft Configuration Manager or Intune.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with Event-driven architecture.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Familiarity with Docker, Kubernetes, and CI/CD pipelines.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Experience with building cross-platform applications or services.&nbsp;</li>\n"},{"text":"Compensation & Benefits:","content":"<div>\n<p><em>We are hiring across multiple levels, with final leveling and compensation determined by the candidate's skills, experience and demonstrated capabilities throughout the interview process.</em></p>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Benefits:</strong></div>\n<div>\n\n<li><strong>401k Match:</strong>&nbsp;Match 200% of contributions up to the first 5% of salary, resulting in a total potential match of 10%.</li>\n<li><strong>Medical, Dental, and Vision Coverage:</strong>&nbsp;Patch My PC covers 99% of premiums for both team members and dependents.</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Other Benefits:</strong></div>\n\n<li>FSA/HSA.</li>\n<li>Fertility benefits.</li>\n<li>Parental leave.</li>\n<li>Paid-time off (PTO).</li>\n<li>Volunteer leave.</li>\n<li>Charitable donation matching.</li>\n<li>Tuition reimbursement.</li>\n<li>Gym membership reimbursement.</li>\n<li>Internet stipend.</li>\n<li>Pet insurance.</li>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><em>Learn more about our benefits here:&nbsp;<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://patchmypc.com/careers#we-care\" class=\"postings-link\">https://patchmypc.com/careers#we-care</a>.<br></em></div>\n</div>"}],"text":"Software Engineer, Backend","country":"US","workplaceType":"remote","opening":"<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>About Our Company:</strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At Patch My PC, we exist to <strong>improve lives</strong>. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Our <a href=\"https://patchmypc.com/values\"><strong><u>core values</u></strong></a> guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.</span></div>","openingPlain":"About Our Company:\n \nAt Patch My PC, we exist to improve lives. What started as a free tool to keep apps updated has grown into a trusted enterprise solution that helps IT and Security teams automate, manage, deploy, and report on third-party updates in Microsoft ConfigMgr, Intune, and WSUS. Our fully remote crew of 150 GIF-loving humans supports over 10,000 customers and more than 32 million devices. We make patching easier, boost security, and give IT teams their time back.\n \nOur core values guide how we work, how we treat each other, and how we grow. They keep us focused on what matters most. We're here to improve the lives of our customers, our team members, and our communities.\n","descriptionBody":"<div>\n<div><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">About this Role:</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">We are looking to hire an Experienced Software Engineer to design, develop, implement, test and support high quality internal software, systems and customer facing products and features that delight customers. You will be a key member of our development team, working to enhance and expand our software management platform.&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>","descriptionBodyPlain":"About this Role:\n \nWe are looking to hire an Experienced Software Engineer to design, develop, implement, test and support high quality internal software, systems and customer facing products and features that delight customers. You will be a key member of our development team, working to enhance and expand our software management platform. \n","hostedUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/patchmypc/21f4037e-2b38-4f87-8877-fd4096d36e7f","applyUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/patchmypc/21f4037e-2b38-4f87-8877-fd4096d36e7f/apply"}]